npm install
```

@kelvinwww/dsh-oauth README · Build：```sh
npm run build
```

@kelvinwww/dsh-oauth README · Type check：```sh
npm run check
```

@kelvinwww/dsh-oauth README · Test：```sh
npm test
```

@kelvinwww/dsh-oauth README · Build browser bundle only：```sh
npm run bundle
```

@kelvinwww/dsh-oauth README · Watch browser bundle：```sh
npm run watch:client
```

@kelvinwww/dsh-oauth README · Package：npm package：

```text
@kelvinwww/dsh-oauth
```

插件入口同时导出 Gemini Adapter、Codex/Gemini service factory 与 storage API，便于测试和二次集成。
